---
title: "emode::update_asset_borrow (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_support: assets_borrows.supports_type(coin)?
    q_check_support --> q_error_support: not supported
    q_check_support --> q_load: supported
    q_error_support --> [*]: abort emode_group_does_not_support_asset
    q_load --> q_calc: current_borrow = assets_borrows.load_mut(coin)
    q_calc --> q_update: new_borrow = new_value + current_borrow - old_value (saturating)
    q_update --> [*]: current_borrow = new_borrow, return new_borrow

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: saturating_sub prevents underflow (clamped to zero)
        INV-002: tracks aggregate borrow per asset per emode group
        INV-003: used to enforce emode max_borrow_amount limit
        INV-004: updated on borrow, repay, and liquidation
    end note
